ttps://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"09c9027a23bca10b97ae2765b4bd4a680343382d","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/commits/09c9027a23bca10b97ae2765b4bd4a680343382d","created_at":"2019-09-09T20:19:37Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/529649951","html_url":"https://github.com/rclone/rclone/issues/3523#issuecomment-529649951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/3523","id":529649951,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyOTY0OTk1MQ==","user":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-09T20:22:25Z","updated_at":"2019-09-09T20:22:25Z","body":"I've implemented\r\n- parallel HEAD requests (controlled by `--checkers`)\r\n- the `--http-no-head` flag\r\n\r\nCan you have a go with those and tell me what you think?\r\n\r\nhttps://beta.rclone.org/branch/v1.49.0-036-g09c9027a-fix-3523-http-beta/ (uploaded in 15-30 mins)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> Perhaps more simply, in my particular case I'm happy to use an include or exclude filter to knock down the file count to a very small number of files. Potentially as low as one. However, the HEAD requests happen before the filters kick in so the delay is the same. Can the HEAD requests occur after the filtering? Hmm, looking closer at the filtering docs I see that size is a possible filter. So maybe not. Can this be done if there is not size filter in use? My case doesn't have one.\r\n\r\nAt the moment the filtering happens after the directory listings are returned from the backends.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice if optionally the backends could use the directory filtering to cut down the amount of work they need to do.\r\n\r\nThis would need a bit of re-organization of the code though...","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/529649951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ncw","id":536803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNjgwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/536803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw","html_url":"https://github.com/ncw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ncw/orgs","repos_u